  "implementation": {
    "library": "Version 2 internal plist, optional stable group UUID on each sky,64 flat groups, strict validation and unchanged ID/name/source bytes through moves. Version 1 reads without rewriting and upgrades only on successful edit. Unknown/corrupt versions preserve files.",
    "native": "Create/rename/delete group dialogs capture selection/filter/library revision. Explicit Keep Skies/Delete Group and Skies choice. Group filter and Move Sky To picker. Native Import supports multiple files; bounded preparation validates all images before one atomic publication.",
    "API": "Existing sky.library gains group.create/group.rename/group.delete/move/importBatch with operation-specific required/allowed fields, UUID/null membership and explicit removeSkies. Existing import accepts optionalgroupID and all old operations remain. State/schema report groups/memberships/filter/dialog/availability. Same library/preparation/history semantics.",
    "history": "Library management does not change document pixels, selection, dirty state or Undo. Imported pixels already embedded in document layers survive later library deletion.",
    "concurrency": "Native dialogs/imports reject captured context changes/closure. API preparation checks token/revision/library/share/cancellation before publication; errors cannot partially import.",
    "formats": "Internal library 2; native 90/Actions 58/266 typed commands unchanged. No dedicated sky HTTP route is defined by the pinned Adobe v2 contract; no Adobe route, UXP/CEP host or action descriptor invented.",
    "menu_cursor": "No factory menu title/order/key or pointer tool/modifier/cursor change."
